<% content_for :title, page_title("About") %>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-mesh"></div>
  <div class="wrap-narrow hero-content">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-pill">Editorial Manifesto</span></p>
    <h1>A quiet sanctuary to write, reflect, and build in public.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      <%= site_name %> is an independent engineering and design publication built on Ruby on Rails.
      Clean typography, fast page loads, and zero distractions.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap-narrow section about-prose">
  <p>
    The web was built for reading. Somewhere along the way, publishing stacks became over-engineered, 
    weighed down with megabytes of JavaScript, trackers, and popup notifications.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <strong><%= site_name %></strong> returns to first principles: server-rendered HTML, semantic markup, 
    crisp type hierarchy, and persistent clean URLs like <code>/why-ruby-still-feels-like-home</code>.
  </p>

  <dl class="stat-row">
    <div class="stat-box">
      <dt>Published Essays</dt>
      <dd><%= @post_count %></dd>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-box">
      <dt>Curated Topics</dt>
      <dd><%= @category_count %></dd>
    </div>
  </dl>

  <div style="background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 2rem; margin: 3rem 0; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Our Publication Pillars</h3>
    <ul style="padding-left: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--text-secondary);">
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem;"><strong>Longevity:</strong> Slugs and category paths remain stable across decades.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem;"><strong>Taste & Craft:</strong> Thoughtful typesetting, comfortable line lengths, and distraction-free layouts.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem;"><strong>Simplicity:</strong> Built with standard Rails conventions, Hotwire Turbo, and pure CSS.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem;">
    <%= link_to "Explore all essays", root_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
    <% unless admin_signed_in? %>
      <%= link_to "Editor login", admin_login_path, class: "btn btn-ghost", style: "margin-left: 0.8rem;" %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</section>
